    "text": "<p>Let <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>E</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>=</mo></math>{<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>x</mi><mo>&#8712;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#8477;</mi><mo>:</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>&#8800;</mo><mn>1</mn></math>&nbsp;and <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><mi>x</mi><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>&#62;</mo><mn>0</mn></math>} and <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>E</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>=</mo></math>{<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>x</mi><mo>&#8712;</mo><msub><mi>E</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>:</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><msup><mi>sin</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><msub><mi>log</mi><mi>e</mi></msub><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mfrac><mi>x</mi><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfrac></mfenced></mrow></mfenced></math>&nbsp;is a real number}</p><p>(Here the&nbsp;inverse trigonometric function&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi>sin</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced></math>&nbsp;assumes values in&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mrow><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#960;</mi><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo>.</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mfrac><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#960;</mi><mn>2</mn></mfrac></mrow></mfenced></math>.)<br />Let <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>f</mi><mo>:</mo><msub><mi>E</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>&#8594;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#8477;</mi></math> be the function defined by <math><mi>f</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mrow><mrow><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">log</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>e</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><mo>&#8289;</mo><mrow><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfrac></mrow></mfenced></mrow></mrow></math><br />And <math><mi>g</mi><mo>:</mo><msub><mrow><mi>E</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub><mo>&#8594;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"double-struck\">R</mi></math> be the function defined by <math><mi>g</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mrow><mrow><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">sin</mi></mrow><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup></mrow><mo>&#8289;</mo><mrow><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mrow><mrow><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">log</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>e</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><mo>&#8289;</mo><mrow><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfrac></mrow></mfenced></mrow></mrow></mrow></mfenced></mrow></mrow></math> .</p><table border=\"1\">\t<tbody>\t\t<tr>\t\t\t<td>LIST-I</td>\t\t\t<td>LIST-II</td>\t\t</tr>\t\t<tr>\t\t\t<td>A. The range of&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>f</mi></math>&nbsp;is</td>\t\t\t<td>P. <math><mfenced close=\"]\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mo>-</mo><mi>&#8734;</mi><mo>,</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><mi>e</mi></mrow></mfrac></mrow></mfenced><mo>&#8746;</mo><mfenced open=\"[\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mi>e</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>e</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>,</mo><mi>&#160;</mi><mi>&#8734;</mi></mrow></mfenced></math></td>\t\t</tr>\t\t<tr>\t\t\t<td>B. The range of&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>g</mi></math>&nbsp;contains</td>\t\t\t<td>Q. (0, 1)</td>\t\t</tr>\t\t<tr>\t\t\t<td>C. The domain of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>f</mi></math>&nbsp;contains</td>\t\t\t<td>R. <math><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>,</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfrac></mrow></mfenced></math></td>\t\t</tr>\t\t<tr>\t\t\t<td>D. The domain of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>g</mi></math>&nbsp;is</td>\t\t\t<td>S. <math><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mo>-</mo><mi>&#8734;</mi><mo>,</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>&#8746;</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>0</mn><mo>,</mo><mi>&#160;</mi><mi>&#8734;</mi></mrow></mfenced></math></td>\t\t</tr>\t\t<tr>\t\t\t<td>&nbsp;</td>\t\t\t<td>T. <math><mfenced close=\"]\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mo>-</mo><mi>&#8734;</mi><mo>,</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>e</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>e</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfrac></mrow></mfenced></math></td>\t\t</tr>\t\t<tr>\t\t\t<td>&nbsp;</td>\t\t\t<td>U. <math> <mrow> <mrow><mo>(</mo> <mrow> <mo>&#8722;</mo><mi>&#8734;</mi><mo>,</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow> <mo>)</mo></mrow><mo>&#8746;</mo><mrow><mo>(</mo> <mrow> <mfrac> <mn>1</mn> <mn>2</mn> </mfrac> <mo>,</mo><mfrac> <mi>e</mi> <mrow> <mi>e</mi><mo>&#8722;</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow> </mfrac> </mrow> <mo>]</mo></mrow></mrow> </math></td>\t\t</tr>\t</tbody></table>The correct option is:",
