    "text": "<math><msub><mrow><mi>E</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><mo>:</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>></mo><mn>0</mn></math><br ><img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/jee_advanced/ehcgdgaijlqtberjqsqvnkjovrvuafptzaouazwsspezyriunt.png\"/><br ><math><mo>⇒</mo></math> <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>E</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>:</mo><mo> </mo><mi>x</mi><mo>∈</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mo>-</mo><mi>∞</mi><mo>,</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>∪</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>,</mo><mi>∞</mi></mrow></mfenced></math><br ><math><msub><mrow><mi>E</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub><mo>:</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>≤</mo><mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">ln</mi></mrow><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfrac></mrow></mfenced></mrow></mrow><mo>≤</mo><mn>1</mn></math><br ><math><mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mi>e</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>≤</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>≤</mo><mi>e</mi></math><br >Now <math><mfrac><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mi>e</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>≥</mo><mn>0</mn></math><br ><math><mo>⇒</mo></math> <math><mfrac><mrow><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>e</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mi>e</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced></mrow></mfrac><mo>≥</mo><mn>0</mn></math><br ><img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/jee_advanced/poivsvjutbssqhdrmnybbwakudfjvfewjgtkmyonhmxpvywgza.png\"/><br ><math><mo>⇒</mo></math> <math><mi>x</mi><mi> </mi><mi>ϵ</mi><mi> </mi><mfenced close=\"]\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mo>-</mo><mi>∞</mi><mo>,</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><mi>e</mi></mrow></mfrac></mrow></mfenced><mo>∪</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>,</mo><mi>∞</mi></mrow></mfenced></math><br >Also <math><mfrac><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>-</mo><mi>e</mi><mo>≤</mo><mn>0</mn></math><br ><math><mfrac><mrow><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>e</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>e</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>≥</mo><mn>0</mn></math><br ><img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/jee_advanced/mwditdcilihbfhuxyfegatzzwrpfqfmbldgzhcmpdxevjecvmv.png\"/><br ><math><mo>⇒</mo></math> <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>x</mi><mo>∈</mo><mfenced close=\"]\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mo>-</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∞</mi><mo>,</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><mi>e</mi></mrow></mfrac></mrow></mfenced><mo>∪</mo><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mfrac><mi>e</mi><mrow><mi>e</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>,</mo><mi> </mi><mi>∞</mi></mrow></mfenced></math><br >As Range of <math><mfrac><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfrac></math> is <math><msup><mrow><mi>R</mi></mrow><mrow><mo>+</mo></mrow></msup><mo>-</mo><mfenced close=\"}\" open=\"{\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced></math><br ><math><mo>⇒</mo></math> Range of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>f</mi></math> is <math><mi>R</mi><mo>-</mo><mfenced close=\"}\" open=\"{\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>0</mn></mrow></mfenced></math> or <math><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mo>-</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∞</mi><mo>,</mo><mi> </mi><mn>0</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>∪</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>0</mn><mo>,</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\"> </mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∞</mi></mrow></mfenced></math><br >Range of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>g</mi></math> is <math><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mo>–</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>π</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>,</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>π</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfrac></mrow></mfenced></math> <math><mo>-</mo><mfenced close=\"}\" open=\"{\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>0</mn></mrow></mfenced></math> or <math><mfenced open=\"[\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mo>–</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>π</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>,</mo><mi> </mi><mn>0</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>∪</mo><mfenced close=\"]\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>0</mn><mo>,</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>π</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfrac></mrow></mfenced></math><br >Now <math><mi>P</mi><mo>→</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>,</mo><mi> </mi><mi>Q</mi><mo>→</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>,</mo><mi> </mi><mi>R</mi><mo>→</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>,</mo><mi> </mi><mi>S</mi><mo>→</mo><mn>1</mn></math><br >Hence <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>A</mi></math> is correct.",
